<h1>Akkio Pricing: Complete 2026 Breakdown</h1>

<p>Akkio is an AI-powered media planning and audience intelligence platform used by agencies including Horizon Media and Havas. It offers AI agents for audience building, strategy development, and automated reporting. Akkio does not currently publish pricing publicly — all plans are custom-quoted through their sales team.</p>

<h2>Pricing Model</h2>

<p>Akkio uses an <strong>enterprise subscription model</strong> with custom pricing based on user count, agency size, and modules licensed. The platform has historically used per-user-per-month billing, but current enterprise contracts are structured as annual team-level agreements.</p>

<p>Historical self-serve pricing of approximately <strong>$49–$60/user/month</strong> has been reported on G2 (<a href="https://www.g2.com/products/akkio/pricing">G2 Akkio Pricing</a>). This appears to no longer be available as Akkio has shifted to enterprise-only go-to-market. These historical figures are provided for context and may not reflect current pricing.</p>

